From: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Date: Wed, 04 Nov 2026 05:38:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Build the Ant propertyfile task

JNA uses propertyfile to store the version and checksum of its JNI headers.
Include the task and its layout-preserving properties implementation in the
bootstrap Ant library.

Upstream: pending
Reference: https://github.com/fedora-java/javapackages-bootstrap/blob/f7f74e76145c0dc4ea4d0d1967ef678ffaa7cf87/project/ant.xml
Signed-off-by: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
---
diff --git a/project/ant.xml b/project/ant.xml
--- a/project/ant.xml
+++ b/project/ant.xml
@@ -52,7 +52,6 @@
         <excludeSourceClass>org/apache/tools/ant/taskdefs/optional/Javah</excludeSourceClass>
         <excludeSourceClass>org/apache/tools/ant/taskdefs/optional/Native2Ascii</excludeSourceClass>
         <excludeSourceClass>org/apache/tools/ant/taskdefs/optional/NetRexxC</excludeSourceClass>
-        <excludeSourceClass>org/apache/tools/ant/taskdefs/optional/PropertyFile</excludeSourceClass>
         <excludeSourceClass>org/apache/tools/ant/taskdefs/optional/RenameExtensions</excludeSourceClass>
         <excludeSourceClass>org/apache/tools/ant/taskdefs/optional/Rpm</excludeSourceClass>
         <excludeSourceClass>org/apache/tools/ant/taskdefs/optional/SchemaValidate</excludeSourceClass>
@@ -311,7 +310,6 @@
         <excludeSourceClass>org/apache/tools/ant/util/CollectionUtils</excludeSourceClass>
         <excludeSourceClass>org/apache/tools/ant/util/DOMUtils</excludeSourceClass>
         <excludeSourceClass>org/apache/tools/ant/util/FirstMatchMapper</excludeSourceClass>
-        <excludeSourceClass>org/apache/tools/ant/util/LayoutPreservingProperties</excludeSourceClass>
         <excludeSourceClass>org/apache/tools/ant/util/LazyHashtable</excludeSourceClass>
         <excludeSourceClass>org/apache/tools/ant/util/Native2AsciiUtils</excludeSourceClass>
         <excludeSourceClass>org/apache/tools/ant/util/PackageNameMapper</excludeSourceClass>
